<a href="#S1.p2.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ The Choice of Divergence: A Neglected Key to Mitigating Diversity Collapse in Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>,
<a href="#S2.p1.1" title="2 Related Work ‣ The Choice of Divergence: A Neglected Key to Mitigating Diversity Collapse in Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2</span></a>.
